values ('d8e9f0a1-2b3c-4d50-9e00-0f1a2b3c4d20', 'supply-chain-information-systems-erp', 'Supply Chain Information Systems / ERP', 'Supply Chain Information Systems / ERP teaches students how enterprise systems connect supply-chain strategy to operational execution. Students study ERP modules, master data, MRP, procure-to-pay, order-to-cash, manufacturing planning, warehouse and logistics systems, analytics, integration, cloud platforms, implementation, internal controls, cybersecurity, and digital transformation. The course is designed around practical process exercises and a capstone ERP-enabled supply-chain transformation case.');

